35
00:02:20,186 --> 00:02:24,402
Treat that question as an observation that needs an explanation.

36
00:02:24,402 --> 00:02:29,540
A useful first claim is: Microevolution is change in allele frequencies across

37
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:33,888
